# Code owners for zones with different review stakes than an ordinary
# runtime-module change: architecture/spec, the quality gates themselves,
# release/coverage policy, security posture, and submodule pins.
#
# See https://docs.github.com/articles/about-code-owners for syntax. Later
# patterns take precedence over earlier ones.

# Specification-first architecture (CONTRIBUTING.md: "Magnetar is
# specification-driven. Architecture and behaviour are defined in openspec/
# and docs/architecture/ before they are implemented").
/openspec/                 @astorise
/docs/architecture/        @astorise

# The quality gates themselves -- a change here alters what every other PR
# must pass.
/.github/workflows/        @astorise

# Release and coverage policy.
/quality/                  @astorise
/release/                  @astorise
/RELEASE_NOTES.md          @astorise

# Security posture.
/SECURITY.md               @astorise

# Submodule pins (formats/*, components/*, providers/*, loaders/*) --
# bumping one changes what every downstream job builds and tests against.
/.gitmodules                @astorise
/SUBMODULES.md              @astorise
